sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 👤 User
    participant Graph as 🧠 LangGraph
    participant Primary as 🎯 Primary Assistant
    participant Agent as 🤖 Specialized Agent
    participant Tools as 🔧 Agent Tools
    participant HITL as ⚠️ HITL System
    participant DB as 🗄️ Database

    User->>Graph: "Đặt phòng CR7 lúc 10:00 ngày mai"
    activate Graph
    
    Note over Graph: Guard validation
    Graph->>Graph: guard_node()
    
    Note over Graph: Fetch user context
    Graph->>Graph: fetch_user_info()
    
    Note over Graph: Route to workflow
    Graph->>Graph: route_to_workflow()
    
    Graph->>Primary: primary_assistant()
    activate Primary
    Primary->>Primary: Analyze intent
    Primary-->>Graph: ToBookingAgent tool call
    deactivate Primary
    
    Note over Graph: Entry node setup
    Graph->>Graph: enter_booking()
    
    Graph->>Agent: booking_agent()
    activate Agent
    Agent->>Agent: Process booking request
    Agent->>Tools: create_booking_tool()
    activate Tools
    
    Note over Tools: HITL Protection
    Tools->>HITL: @hitl_protected decorator
    activate HITL
    HITL-->>Tools: interrupt(interrupt_data)
    deactivate HITL
    
    Tools-->>Agent: INTERRUPT signal
    deactivate Tools
    Agent-->>Graph: Interrupt state
    deactivate Agent
    
    Graph-->>User: "⚠️ Xác nhận: Đặt phòng họp"
    deactivate Graph
    
    Note over User,DB: User confirms
    User->>Graph: {"action": "approve"}
    activate Graph
    Graph->>Graph: resume_from_interrupt()
    
    Graph->>Agent: booking_agent() (resumed)
    activate Agent
    Agent->>Tools: create_booking_tool() (continue)
    activate Tools
    Tools->>DB: INSERT INTO bookings
    activate DB
    DB-->>Tools: Success
    deactivate DB
    Tools-->>Agent: Booking created
    deactivate Tools
    Agent-->>Graph: CompleteOrEscalate
    deactivate Agent
    
    Graph->>Graph: leave_skill()
    Graph->>Primary: primary_assistant()
    activate Primary
    Primary-->>Graph: Final response
    deactivate Primary
    
    Graph-->>User: "✅ Đặt phòng CR7 thành công!"
    deactivate Graph
